tent=\"好天使不動產財商團隊\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"zh_TW\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"好天使不動產財商團隊\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育，陪伴學員建立專業的不動產財商能力。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png?icon.2etjumr285i_o.png\" sizes=\"1254x1254\" type=\"image/png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 border-b border-brand-900/10 bg-paper/90 backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"container-shell flex h-20 items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-900 text-sm font-semibold text-ivory transition duration-300 group-hover:bg-brand-800\">G</div><div class=\"leading-none\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-900\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-muted\">GOOD ANGEL</p></div></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 lg:flex\"><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav><a class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 bg-brand-900 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-ivory transition duration-300 hover:bg-brand-800 lg:inline-flex\" href=\"/career\">加入我們<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"開啟選單\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center border border-brand-900/20 text-brand-900 transition hover:bg-brand-900 hover:text-ivory lg:hidden\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">☰</span></button></div></header><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 pt-20 text-ivory\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-20 md:py-24 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-200\">OUR SERVICES</p></div></div><div><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">我們提供的專業學習內容</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/60 md:text-lg md:leading-9\">從購屋策略、稅務觀念到資產配置，建立完整的不動產財商思維。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative\"><div class=\"h-px bg-white/10\"></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-paper\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">WHY GOOD ANGEL</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Learning · Practice · Teamwork · Growth</p></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]\">一份工作的價值，<br/>不只在今天做了什麼，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">也在明天成為什麼樣的人。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg\">我們重視知識的累積，也重視實務經驗與團隊交流。 在好天使，每一次學習與參與，都能成為建立專業能力的一部分。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 border-t border-brand-900/15 md:mt-20\"><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">LEARNING</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">從學習開始</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">透過不動產、財商與市場相關知識的累積，逐步建立對產業的理解，讓專業不是背答案，而是真的知道如何判斷。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">02</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">PRACTICE</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">從實務累積經驗</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">把學到的觀念帶進真實案例與工作情境，在一次次接觸與討論中，累積屬於自己的實務經驗。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">03</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">TEAMWORK</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">和團隊一起前進</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">透過交流、經驗分享與彼此協作，讓遇到的問題不必只靠自己摸索，也讓不同背景的經驗能彼此成為養分。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group grid gap-6 border-b border-brand-900/15 py-9 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-100/40 md:grid-cols-[0.15fr_0.25fr_0.6fr] md:items-start md:px-5 md:py-12\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">04</span><div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-muted\">GROWTH</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">找到自己的發展方向</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl leading-8 text-muted\">在持續學習與實務累積的過程中，更了解自己的能力與興趣，逐步探索適合自己的專業與職涯方向。</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden text-xl text-gold transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 md:block\">→</span></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-20 bg-brand-900 px-7 py-12 text-ivory md:px-12 md:py-16 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">GROW WITH US</p><h3 class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl\">我們尋找的，<br/>不只是已經準備好的人。</h3></div><div><p class=\"max-w-xl leading-8 text-white/65\">比起一開始就什麼都會，我們更期待願意理解產業、持續學習， 並且願意與團隊共同累積經驗的夥伴。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-16 bg-gold\"></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-start md:py-16\"><div><a class=\"inline-block\" href=\"/\"><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] text-white\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</p></a><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 與願意學習、願意成長的夥伴一起累積專業。</p></div><nav class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:text-right\"><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-6 text-[11px] text-white/35 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 好天使不動產財商團隊</p><p class=\"tracking-[0.16em]\">REAL ESTATE · FINANCE · GROWTH</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3z5q_p4msz2ha.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[